2) Search internally for the earliest‑dated headstone (e.g., by looking for the 1970s or earliest year listed); 
3) Open that headstone’s detail view to read the rhyme; and 
4) Identify any adjacent headstones visible in the background and capture their rhymes.  This targeted approach would have avoided the redundant scrolling loop and moved the conversation toward the required answer, thereby preventing the final output from remaining incorrect.

